        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global GH835SE, Heavy Duty 9\" Security Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExtra large, the Colossal 9 Inch Padlockable Security Bolt isn't just another wimpy door bolt. This Heavy Duty 9 inch Security Bolt is oversized and made from heavy duty steel. This Slide Bolt is built with toughness in mind. It is hefty and large, perfect for locking up your most important doors. It has a silver epoxy finish. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it, including hardware, strike plate, and bolt guide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Aluminum Heavy Duty Security Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy duty</li>\r\n<li>Durable sliver epoxy finish</li>\r\n<li>Surface application</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with all mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Global GH-835SE Security Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Plate Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Width: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-23/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
